{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103501","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103501","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:1:1710350101:0":{"text":"마법 갑옷에게 붙잡힌 페기는, 하늘과 땅이 뒤집히는 듯한 현기증과 함께 출발점으로 돌아왔다","source_cn":"佩吉被魔法盔甲逮个正着，一阵天旋地转后，她回到了原点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A82C4DBC16E0F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1710350103:0":{"text":"페기의 발소리에 전당의 갑옷이 깨어났고, 그녀는 입구로 물러날 수밖에 없었다","source_cn":"佩吉的脚步声唤醒了圣堂的盔甲，她只能避退回入口。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE143C22A469FC1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1710350102:0":{"text":"차가운 갑옷이 페기를 붙잡았다. 한 줄기 빛이 번쩍인 후, 페기는 다시 출발점으로 돌아왔다","source_cn":"冰冷的铠甲按住了佩吉，一阵白光过后，她又回到了起点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C36EEEFC7BC111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏文本":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏文本","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}